    "before": "<section id=\"assignment4\" class=\"a4\" aria-labelledby=\"a4-title\">\n  <header class=\"a4-heading\"><span class=\"wb-overline\">TECH 3498 · ASSIGNMENT 4</span><h2 id=\"a4-title\">Identity. Permission. Presence.</h2><p>One session. One K.E.A.N. assistant. Three interactive demonstrations.</p><span id=\"a4-role\" class=\"a4-pill\">NOT AUTHENTICATED</span></header>\n  <div class=\"a4-grid\">\n    <section class=\"a4-card\" aria-labelledby=\"a4-access-title\">\n      <span class=\"wb-overline\">01 · AUTHENTICATION &amp; AUTHORIZATION</span><h3 id=\"a4-access-title\">Who are you? What can you do?</h3>\n      <p>Educational client-side RBAC. Roles are self-selected for this demo; production permissions must be enforced by a server.</p>\n      <ol class=\"a4-flow\" id=\"a4-access-flow\" aria-label=\"Access decision workflow\"><li>LOGIN</li><li>AUTHENTICATED</li><li>ROLE</li><li>PERMISSION CHECK</li><li>ALLOW / DENY</li></ol>\n      <label for=\"a4-action\">Attempt an action</label><select id=\"a4-action\"><option value=\"profile.view\">View Personal Information</option><option value=\"profile.edit\">Edit Personal Profile</option><option value=\"users.manage\">Manage Users</option><option value=\"logs.view\">View Security Logs</option><option value=\"content.manage\">Manage Website Content</option></select>\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"a4-check\" class=\"wb-button\">Check permission</button><p id=\"a4-decision\" role=\"status\">Sign in using the existing login to begin.</p>\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"a4-end-session\" class=\"stride-action-btn\">End demo session / change role</button>\n      <section id=\"a4-profile\" hidden><h4>Demo profile</h4><p>Fictional data only. Changes last for this session.</p><p id=\"a4-profile-summary\"></p><label for=\"a4-profile-name\">Demo display name</label><input id=\"a4-profile-name\" maxlength=\"40\" value=\"Demo Student\"><label for=\"a4-profile-focus\">Learning focus</label><select id=\"a4-profile-focus\"><option>Web security</option><option>Threat modeling</option><option>Access control</option></select><button type=\"button\" id=\"a4-profile-save\" class=\"wb-button\">Save demo profile</button></section>\n      <section id=\"a4-users\" hidden><h4>Manage simulated users</h4><p>These fictional accounts do not affect your active role or real accounts.</p><div class=\"a4-table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Username</th><th>Role</th><th>Status</th><th>Simulated actions</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"a4-user-list\"></tbody></table></div><p id=\"a4-user-detail\" role=\"status\"></p></section>\n      <section id=\"a4-logs\" hidden><h4>Existing SecurityState events</h4><p>Latest 20 events from Live Telemetry.</p><button type=\"button\" id=\"a4-log-refresh\" class=\"stride-action-btn\">Refresh security logs</button><pre id=\"a4-log-output\"></pre></section>\n      <section id=\"a4-content\" hidden><h4>Simulated content management</h4><p>This changes only the preview below. Website source and graded coursework cannot be edited here.</p><label for=\"a4-content-text\">Demo announcement</label><textarea id=\"a4-content-text\" maxlength=\"180\" rows=\"3\">Welcome to the security lab.</textarea><button type=\"button\" id=\"a4-content-save\" class=\"wb-button\">Update simulated preview</button><p id=\"a4-content-preview\">Welcome to the security lab.</p></section>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"a4-card\" aria-labelledby=\"a4-person-title\">\n      <span class=\"wb-overline\">03 · DIGITAL PERSON LAB</span><h3 id=\"a4-person-title\">K.E.A.N. // Your digital presence</h3>\n      <span class=\"a4-pill\">LOCAL DIGITAL PERSON SIMULATION</span><p>The photo stays in this page’s memory. This is a styled photo avatar, not AI-generated imagery or lip-sync.</p>\n      <ol id=\"a4-person-flow\" class=\"a4-flow\" aria-label=\"Digital person workflow\"><li>01 UPLOAD</li><li>02 GENERATE</li><li>03 TALK <small>(optional)</small></li><li>04 ASK</li><li>05 RESPONSE</li></ol>\n      <div id=\"a4-avatar\" class=\"a4-avatar\" data-state=\"idle\"><img id=\"a4-photo\" alt=\"Your local demo avatar\" hidden><div id=\"a4-photo-placeholder\">K.E.A.N.<small>Upload a demo portrait to begin</small></div><div class=\"a4-scan\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span id=\"a4-avatar-state\" class=\"a4-avatar-state\" role=\"status\">IDLE</span></div>\n      <label for=\"a4-photo-file\">Upload or replace photo · PNG, JPEG, WEBP · up to 5 MB</label><input id=\"a4-photo-file\" type=\"file\" accept=\"image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp\"><p id=\"a4-photo-status\" role=\"status\">No photo selected.</p>\n      <div class=\"a4-buttons\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"a4-generate\" class=\"wb-button\" disabled>Generate demo avatar</button><button type=\"button\" id=\"a4-clear\" class=\"stride-action-btn\">Clear photo / reset</button><button type=\"button\" id=\"a4-talk\" class=\"stride-action-btn\" disabled>Talk · shared K.E.A.N. microphone</button></div>\n      <p id=\"a4-generation-status\">No external avatar-generation service connected.</p>\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"a4-chat-title\"><span class=\"wb-overline\">02 · EXISTING K.E.A.N. CHATBOT</span><h4 id=\"a4-chat-title\">Ask K.E.A.N.</h4><p id=\"a4-chat-flow\" role=\"status\">TYPE QUESTION → AI PROCESSES → RECEIVE ANSWER</p>\n        <form id=\"a4-question-form\"><label for=\"a4-question\">Question or website command</label><textarea id=\"a4-question\" rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"2000\" placeholder=\"Tell us about authentication and authorization with examples\" required></textarea><button type=\"submit\" class=\"wb-button\">Ask K.E.A.N.</button></form>\n        <span id=\"a4-answer-source\" class=\"a4-pill\">READY · SHARED K.E.A.N. ROUTER</span><p id=\"a4-answer\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Typed questions work with or without a photo. Connect Gemini or Claude for live AI; local fallback remains available.</p>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</section>",
